{"id":"CVE-2010-0433","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"redhat","published":"2010-03-05T19:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-07T00:52:17.351Z","description":"The kssl_keytab_is_available function in ssl/kssl.c in OpenSSL before 0.9.8n, when Kerberos is enabled but Kerberos configuration files cannot be opened, does not check a certain return value, which allows remote attackers to cause a denial of service (NULL pointer dereference and daemon crash) via SSL cipher negotiation, as demonstrated by a chroot installation of Dovecot or stunnel without Kerberos configuration files inside the chroot.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0916","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_VUPEN"],"name":"ADV-2010-0916"},{"url":"http://secunia.com/advisories/42724","tags":["third-party-advisory","x_refsource_SECUNIA"],"name":"42724"},{"url":"http://secunia.com/advisories/39461","tags":["third-party-advisory","x_refsource_SECUNIA"],"name":"39461"},{"url":"https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A9856","tags":["vdb-entry","signature","x_refsource_OVAL"],"name":"oval:org.mitre.oval:def:9856"},{"url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=569774","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-April/039561.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_FEDORA"],"name":"FEDORA-2010-5357"},{"url":"http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=127557640302499&w=2","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_HP"],"name":"HPSBUX02531"},{"url":"https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A12260","tags":["vdb-entry","signature","x_refsource_OVAL"],"name":"oval:org.mitre.oval:def:12260"},{"url":"http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2010/03/03/5","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],"name":"[oss-security] 20100303 OpenSSL (with KRB5) remot